<title>JAPAN: KDD down on foreign, institutional selling.</title>
<headline>KDD down on foreign, institutional selling.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Kokusai Denshin Denwa Co Ltd (KDD) dropped sharply on Thursday afternoon on selling by foreign investors and domestic institutional investors.</p>
<p>The shares were down 270 yen at 7,990 yen at 0545 GMT, below the previous low for the year of 8,180 yen seen on January 29.</p>
</text>
